  "details": "Steamvr has an option to display a graph showcasing frames over time, green means good , red means (bad) and magenta pinkish means display error. For whatever reason when I use any menu in vrc I get a display error spike in steamvr. additionally when I switch to desktop view and back into the game it will sometimes reduce framerate to 10fps and keep it there. additionally just opening the menu and looking at the worlds and just turning my head side to side also creates immense display error spikes. The attached image isn't my own but I found it online and the display error ratio is about the same to mine when using the menu, moving my head around using the menu and switching worlds or exiting the menu.",
